\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The running example $Q_1 \to Q_6$ as a horizontal pipeline. Each box is a logical plan; the arrows denote data flow. The fusion policy $0.7\cdot d_1 + 0.3\cdot d_2$ lives in the $\tau $ operator of $Q_5$; the substrate has no opinion on the weights. The optimizer uses M1 to push $Q_4$'s selection below $Q_3$'s materializations, computing $d_1$ and $d_2$ only on rows that survive the filter.}}{6}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{3}{6}{The running example $Q_1 \to Q_6$ as a horizontal pipeline. Each box is a logical plan; the arrows denote data flow. The fusion policy $0.7\cdot d_1 + 0.3\cdot d_2$ lives in the $\tau $ operator of $Q_5$; the substrate has no opinion on the weights. The optimizer uses M1 to push $Q_4$'s selection below $Q_3$'s materializations, computing $d_1$ and $d_2$ only on rows that survive the filter}{figure.caption.7}{}}
